# Tips and Tricks for Spotting AI Fictions

Developing habits of skepticism and verification is the best way to prevent the spread of misinformation through AI fictions.

>**💬 Quick Reflection:** When have you encountered an AI response that didn’t seem quite right? What made you question it?

Use the guide below to identify common signs of AI fiction and strategies you can use to respond.

<div style="max-width:90%; margin:0 auto; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#2F2F2F;">

<div style="border:2px solid #000; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;">

<!-- Header -->
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;">
<div style="background:#FDF4F2; padding:8px 12px; font-weight:700; font-size:20px; border-right:1px solid #DDD;">
🚩 Red Flags to Watch For
</div>
<div style="background:#F2FBF8; padding:8px 12px; font-weight:700; font-size:20px;">
🛠 What to Do Next
</div>
</div>

<!-- Content -->
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:6px; padding:8px;">

<!-- Row 1 -->
<div style="background:#F8F6F6; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Confident answers without evidence</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
The response sounds certain but provides no sources or explanation.
</span>
</div>

<div style="background:#FAFBFC; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Ask follow-up questions</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Request evidence, examples, or ask the AI to explain its reasoning.
</span>
</div>

<!-- Row 2 -->
<div style="background:#F8F6F6; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Vague, incomplete, or inconsistent information</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Details are missing, overly general, or don't logically fit together.
</span>
</div>

<div style="background:#FAFBFC; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Ask for more specifics</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Prompt for clearer explanations, examples, or additional detail.
</span>
</div>

<!-- Row 3 -->
<div style="background:#F8F6F6; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Facts or citations that seem questionable</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Claims, quotes, or references cannot be easily verified.
</span>
</div>

<div style="background:#FAFBFC; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Cross-check with reliable sources</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Verify important information using trusted sources or another tool.
</span>
</div>

<!-- Row 4 -->
<div style="background:#F8F6F6; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">The response seems "too good to be true"</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
The answer is polished but may oversimplify or overlook important nuance.
</span>
</div>

<div style="background:#FAFBFC; border-radius:10px; padding:6px;">
<strong style="font-size:17px;">Use professional judgment</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.3; color:#555;">
Treat AI as a starting point and decide what to trust, revise, or verify.
</span>
</div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
MARKDOWN
